  abilityName: Pyromagnetic Strike
  abilityDesc: 20 combo Dark attack on all foes, 3 combo Dark attack on single foe
    (damage relative to remaining HP), boosts Atk, Def, Rec and critical rate (Dark)
    for 3 turns, boosts spark damage (Dark) for 3 turns, spark damage fills BB gauge
    for 3 turns & boosts own spark damage for 3 turns
